# What the published archive leaves out.
#
# `.pubignore` replaces `.gitignore` for publishing, so the git exclusions are
# repeated below. `bin/` matters most: a Dart SDK unpacked there for local use
# would otherwise be packaged.
#
# Published: lib/, README.md, LICENSE, pubspec.yaml.

# Publish-only: internal to this repository.
# The live suite and its run settings.
test/
dart_test.yaml
DEVELOPMENT.md
ENDPOINTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
.gitignore
.pubignore
analysis_options.yaml
.env.example

# Also excluded from git.
bin/
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
doc/api/
pubspec.lock
scratchpad/
.env
.env.*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
